flowchart TD
    C[Client ChatRequest] --> API[FastAPI /agent_chat or /agent_chat/stream]
    API --> PREP[refresh/revise preparation and file import]
    PREP --> WF[LangGraph workflow.ainvoke]
    WF --> MARKERS[compatibility marker nodes]
    MARKERS --> DISPATCH[skill_dispatch]
    DISPATCH --> H[DataAnalysisOrchestrator.handle]
    H --> IDEM[response fingerprint and execution lock in SessionStore]
    IDEM --> MQ{multi-question candidate}
    MQ -->|yes| MP[MultiQuestionPlanner rules plus optional model]
    MP --> DAG[execute up to five atomic tasks]
    MQ -->|no| CORE[_handle]
    DAG --> CORE
    CORE --> STATE[load PendingState task frame last request recent frames datasets]
    STATE --> RULES[rule classification and TurnAdmissionGate]
    RULES --> REWRITE[QuestionRewriter]
    REWRITE --> VEC1[Oagnet entity-attributes search]
    REWRITE --> INTENT[HybridIntentClassifier]
    INTENT --> LLM1[structured intent model optional]
    INTENT --> MERGE[pending merge or slot protection and inheritance]
    MERGE --> VEC2[ground filters and display slots via Oagnet]
    VEC2 --> COMPLETE[intent-specific required_missing_slots]
    COMPLETE -->|missing or ambiguity| PENDING[CAS write PendingState and clarification]
    COMPLETE -->|complete| DS{safe local dataset operation}
    DS -->|yes| MINIO[load immutable MinIO dataset and execute whitelist operation]
    DS -->|no| ASL[HTTP adapter to Oagnet /agent/query for semantic plan and ASL]
    ASL --> SQLGEN[HTTP adapter to SQL generation service]
    SQLGEN --> SQLEXEC[HTTP adapter to read-only SQL execution service]
    SQLEXEC --> DATASET[persist result rows or trusted export to MinIO and Redis reference]
    MINIO --> ANALYSIS[deterministic analysis engine and result validation]
    DATASET --> ANALYSIS
    ANALYSIS --> SYNTH[optional evidence-grounded synthesis model]
    SYNTH --> EXT[optional tool selection model and governed extension execution]
    EXT --> SAVE[write task frame last request response cache]
    SAVE --> RESP[AgentResponse]
    RESP --> WF
    WF --> API
    API -->|stream endpoint| SSE[SSE progress plus answer chunks plus complete event]

    REDIS[(Redis short-term state)] --- IDEM
    REDIS --- STATE
    REDIS --- PENDING
    REDIS --- SAVE
    EVENTS[(bounded Redis event list)] --- RULES
    EVENTS --- MERGE
    EVENTS --- DS
    MILVUS[(Milvus knowledge_base collections)] --- VEC1
    MILVUS --- VEC2
    MYSQL[(MySQL semantic metadata and opt-in long-term preferences)] --- ASL
    MYSQL --- MERGE
